# Without this, `COPY . .` drags the Rust build tree (gigabytes) and the whole git history
# into the image and invalidates the layer cache on every rebuild.
.git
.gitignore
.codegraph

sensor/target
sensor/fuzz/target
sensor/fuzz/corpus
sensor/fuzz/artifacts

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info

docker/README.md
*.md
!README.md
